      "published": true,
      "reason": null,
      "manual_approved": false,
      "our_answer": [
        3
      ],
      "blind_answer": 3,
      "confidence": "high",
      "blind_working": "A is correct. B is wrong: covalent character decreases water solubility. C is correct: AgCl is less soluble than expected. D is wrong: a larger anion is more polarisable. E is correct."
    },
    {
