      "blind_working": "Measured values: CH3Cl about 1.87 D, CH2Cl2 about 1.60 D, CHCl3 about 1.04 D, CCl4 = 0 (symmetric). So CH3Cl > CH2Cl2 > CHCl3 > CCl4."
    },
    {
