      "blind_working": "A is true: axial P-Cl bonds are longer and weaker. B is false: hybrid orbitals form only sigma bonds. C is true: [NiCl4]2- is tetrahedral and [Ni(CN)4]2- is square planar. D is false: filled orbitals can also hybridise. E is true: solid PCl5 is [PCl4]+[PCl6]-. So A, C and E are correct."
