      ],
      "blind_answer": 4,
      "confidence": "high",
      "blind_working": "o-Nitrophenol is the steam-volatile isomer, because intramolecular H-bonding stops it associating with other molecules. p-Nitrophenol is associated through intermolecular H-bonds and is not steam volatile. So A is false and R is true."
    },
    {
